  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「ん～……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あぁもう。たまにはプロの仕事も参考にしよう～と思って、女性誌を買いそろえてみたんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「意味なかったかもね、屁のつっぱりにもなりゃしないわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「当たり前だけど。どこの女性誌も、この時期はバレンタイン一色だわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「『初めてでもできる！　チョコのつくりかた♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「『おすすめデートスポット♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「『彼氏とラブラブになる方法♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「……う～ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「んなもん、こちとら興味ないのよ！　つうか、使えないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「うちの学校、ほぼ女子しかいないもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「恋愛とか、びみょうにホットな話題じゃないのよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「しかし恋愛抜きでバレンタインつってもね～、盛りあがりに欠けるわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「ど～しようかしら、今週の記事は？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「ちょうど来週からバレンタインだし、題材にしないわけにもいかないけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「どうもなぁ、ピントがあわないっていうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「読み手が興味を示すものを、最適なかたちで提示する。それが我ら新聞部の使命よ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「でもなぁ、う～ん？　バレンタインねぇ、う～んう～ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「もちろん友達に～、とか家族に～、とかでチョコをつくったり渡したりはするんだろうけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「だから、チョコのつくりかたぐらいは掲載するべきかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「でも、それじゃあちっともワクワクしないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「そんな毒にも薬にもならない報道は、放送部に任せときゃいいのよっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あたしたち新聞部はもっとこう……ワイルドで！　ギラギラしてなくちゃ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「読者の心に火を点けなくちゃいけないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「暇な主婦が趣味でやってる回覧板じゃないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「君咲学院新聞部は、もっと高尚かつ情熱的なジャーナリスト集団なのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「そうよ、うちの新聞部だけの独自性を大事にしなくちゃ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「読者の心に火種を投げこむのよ、いつだって！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「これはあたしのプライドの問題なのよ……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「でもなぁ、う～ん？　うむむむ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あぁもう、考えすぎて知恵熱がでそうだわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「だいたい、何で世間の女の子はそんなに恋バナが好きなのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「どこのページを開いても恋愛恋愛恋愛……か～っ、ぺっぺ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「そんなに面白いもんなのかしら、恋とか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「う～む、あたしはさっぱり胸がときめかないけどなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「そうよ、恋バナと怪談はうちの新聞には必要ないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「まぁ恋愛でも、ゴシップ寄りの話題ならちょっとは刺激的で楽しいんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「他人の恋バナはゴタゴタしてるのにかぎるわよね～、でもなぁ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「うちの学校にも、いちおう男子がいるけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あの転校生、なぜか恋バナにぜんぜん絡まないのよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「ゴタゴタどころか、まったくネタが発生しないのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あの転校生、マジで浮いた話のひとつもないけど何なのよ。ホモなんじゃないの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あいつが転校してきたときは、もっと大騒動が巻き起こるんじゃないかな～って期待したのになぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「のほほんと健全に過ごしちゃってさぁ、ほんと退屈なやつだわ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「こうなったら、あたしが転校生をゆ～わくでもして自作自演……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「いや、だめよ深鳥ふみ。それはジャーナリストとして、やってはいけないことだわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あぁ、もう！　何か面倒くさくなってきちゃったなぁ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「今週の記事は、ひよのに丸投げしようかしら。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あの子は、『そっち方面』にもわりと興味があるみたいだし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「あたしが苦手なものは、ひよのが得意。あたしに欠けたところは、ひよのが埋める。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「そうよ、これは適材適所なのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「ってことで、考えるのや～めたっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「今週の記事はひよのにパスして、あたしは来週の記事を……うん？」"
  },
